  "facets": [
    {
      "title": "Structure and components",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "SQL Interface schemas describe document structure, including polymorphism, sparse fields and nested data, and provide metadata for SQL-to-MongoDB translation. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:b9b15800c9862e239f724189ddfa975f22ff384aa3d3ff7f0071fdc040695552",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:a2e119ce801b8ab05370c6e65912e80f334bc3ae666ec08dfc3f386e281a524b"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "How it works",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Schemas reside in each database's reserved __sql_schemas collection; the mongosql CLI can read this collection when translating queries. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:61b77bcc211d828d0746c810cdd05abf9ca1086ee015b6c3580cd4d1defa920d",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:759b14d98f5256cd5abf7e1a8d7ea5a151d231594e6eba2b7e9ca4640ee280c8",
            "ev:f30f5ea5288dd1427864f91ddf9b4283180ebccdf0ad534b01ce4d92f5fcc01d"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The broad no-sampling description has a view-specific exception: the CLI derives view schemas from pipelines and source schemas, but executes and samples view output when derivation is unavailable. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:0190ee90604d6dea56733b4f7e481939baebf9a70173852bf7a53fada6725d73",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:4677ed66d50a147847a37dbc90fad8969913a9d646629a486b6095640c7263b4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The default action is merge; overwrite replaces existing schemas, while clear removes the schema field. Unstable schemas require overwrite because merge leaves them unchanged. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:5c90386f57b2d8084341175902cda494dd066381ff52041397a6fe22529eba24",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:0e2fb28c4288755c3f97a924b9c7265333e4a9710960153498e2a315c253fc7a"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Problems, failure modes and limitations",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "CLI-generated schemas and Atlas Data Federation schemas are separate and cannot be reused across those deployment paths. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema-management.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:2c3ce8af8baed860b56e4813e4df99ea17cda442e1ecd4bb5ec40e76e0914041",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:294ca8adc79ad08bd2d95ef1fe1e18a949cc67426115c1f92d3534456f5d59dc"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Comparisons and alternatives",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Collection schema generation analyzes every document rather than sampling; view inference can fall back to sampling view output. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:34ae67c52e2bbe1a589a250f4e222e6743e3f492eeee6c320b1ee7a5364ebc8c",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:37b21a0c0983c43a0f622750d9b9bc3af0361495d9231781e52406f6a5393d7d"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For collections, the CLI analyzes every document rather than inferring a schema from a sample. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:05ae75c04c1c960e5c73d09030e6c184476b00ef880122a9220ae6d1b1d43c97",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:5cfd35bb449dc743586c96dda6e51ab56cfd425395c8cae0b6eeb0afc624e7f9"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Facts and statements",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Atlas dedicated clusters M10 and above use the MongoDB SQL Schema Builder CLI for schema management; the same CLI also serves self-managed Enterprise Advanced deployments. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-09-29)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:c5a302b9833f7ddcd7255dbf6c64303da9b62c71ae57dbb6277f36f96ca019a7",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:7dd1644661155d47f3116d11605fc0d10a09748894af5d2b32eb07255dd9b067",
            "ev:9f7998d0d05e77eb66f3e158db4af1685f925bbece6f2ef854730d4a8fcce106"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Schema refresh is user-initiated. Regenerate after data-shape changes; periodic refresh requires external scheduling such as cron. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:0e739fa4ee1871dd69818ec9cae23e701fa720178235da2fc65d9003a2bdc217",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:846d6b6ec535ccd8d017d246d7cda3de48dce310a5c958723f3c60a0a038ca58"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Highly polymorphic collections can produce unstable schemas with capped fields and additionalProperties=true; default merge skips them, so refresh requires overwrite. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:431ede32e7b572b8cda0d77541ef9fd7d9e803ca0fefe958eb40312f05c1e286",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:9db2a8400d46151efa288f44957ca9161ff30d228fd40bf776974e54b4e6aa96"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The binary is mongodb-schema-manager. Namespace include/exclude flags select work; dry-run checks those patterns without schema analysis or database writes. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:47fd12e5d521ab858a880eae062f0b94b2c22ff467adebb8110ab37fd8b18207",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:6c86049617c393f777485cf7ce6240c323a100be190bfb3c78520aece445fc62"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atlas dedicated-cluster generation requires SQL Interface enablement and read access to __mdb_internal_sqlinterface; schema writes additionally require find, insert and update on __sql_schemas. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:802da62e978588caf6cede4c3245585c8011e7cc73c40528cf403ca0a5a10bca",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:9ca0acab1ce86e5ae3c023f6514fa4ccf2247bad3944284390a00d4df736c3f0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "CVE-2026-19502 concerns plaintext authentication settings in CLI diagnostic output. MongoDB lists versions 1.0.0 through versions below 1.2.1 as affected. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-08-12)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/resources/products/alerts",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:7c10fb3be8708a1a366ea107339e0e1e4383b3b32872c78f4d9ceda5c018ae8b",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:3e6750a1f62b8a76bd487ece53c7e9b0882a3c36f5e78ada256704bd8b33ff80",
            "ev:c1b8fde2ebd1b0f22b2e1490e5f5a67f4cf65a2597d9f5c642e8a5fe90267ddf"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The July 9, 2026 changelog says CLI 1.2.1 redacts connection strings and passwords and fixes unchecked protocol-handler launch. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-07-09)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/changelog.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:011f98e74a49169dbe610a0da68a4dfca17c6fea299315965136f85a3c42f5f9",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:ccb9ddfb8a0037f2167fab3d82c6f4e8ecae1a7c4f651aa5e21d38905b699755"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MongoDB's security alerts separately identify unchecked OIDC endpoint schemes as CVE-2026-19503, affecting CLI 1.0.1 through versions below 1.2.1. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-08-12)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/resources/products/alerts",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:0f8cf52ae685bf4c4cfb921e79e7152619a589ae036ca0d25a678b7772531102",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:c88182d65793dd939645a9ae7096ac121e6e6f87f2f47dc02fffff330fe8e85e"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The binary is mongodb-schema-manager. It writes one schema document per namespace to each database's __sql_schemas collection, which the documentation reserves for CLI management. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:00f4ddd164cd05efde3e37270baefd0cc4129fe22b3b43ec8c0bfbda3b6be6b6",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:7d00ef9fd8b2e7b5982b736943e3a64250cba4339417ef66ac0e0f1181253593"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Highly polymorphic documents can yield unstable schemas with capped field capture and additionalProperties=true; those schemas may incompletely represent their namespace. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:e17bc79850bfc8312dccb5513d1867400a1dae765e16dc9e94e095727da64931",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:3308c2bead8190b028ed91a4a6ece7a59eb75e191b1187b019eca081e5ed6060"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namespace include and exclude flags accept glob patterns, exclusion wins, and --dry-run checks namespace selection without analyzing schemas or writing to the database. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:2eef7d988b50ecb6c8f228853bffd8a1b05152db50136f7781b3caa35d195a47",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:8af6519d33164e1df2ec6e07769a08d89f3c7c2b7e316d2ea34fcd0b34c0867d"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The CLI needs read access to processed databases plus find, insert and update on __sql_schemas; dedicated-cluster use additionally needs read access to __mdb_internal_sqlinterface. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/sql-interface/schema/schema-builder-cli.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:56ecc0c05984eff53f3fc3e87ffc12c84d62ea76485b60d951b4d532f3177550",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:81ff4ac8c766cfb95772a0b596ae9c54b3bb7dccc94fa37430cdad63bad0f41f"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MongoDB's security alerts identify CVE-2026-19502 as plaintext diagnostic disclosure affecting Schema Builder CLI versions from 1.0.0 before 1.2.1. MongoDB's July 9, 2026 changelog records credential redaction in 1.2.1, and CERT-In also lists pre-1.2.1 versions as affected. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-08-17)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/resources/products/alerts",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:fd18e56a0620ef21f6acb5941b7fce22064042b7d65518f57cc837cebe43e0bf",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:08aa68d96a0650ce5f51b358f89f7ca9a56230cd2e2e9820c9577ffa73d740f1",
            "ev:c1b8fde2ebd1b0f22b2e1490e5f5a67f4cf65a2597d9f5c642e8a5fe90267ddf",
            "ev:ccb9ddfb8a0037f2167fab3d82c6f4e8ecae1a7c4f651aa5e21d38905b699755"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MongoDB's security alerts assign the OIDC endpoint-validation defect to CVE-2026-19503 and list Schema Builder CLI versions from 1.0.1 before 1.2.1 as affected. The changelog instead groups the protocol-handler and credential-redaction fixes under CVE-2026-19502, so the CVE attribution needs care. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-08-12)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/resources/products/alerts",
